Package: absva
Type: Project
Title: ABSVA — ABS Value Added (Catcher Run-Value Metric)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Kevin", "Collins", email = "kcollinsindy@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Open-source pipeline + Shiny dashboard for ABSVA, a catcher
    performance metric under MLB's Automatic Ball-Strike challenge system.
    Scrapes Statcast and MLB Stats API data, classifies each pitch into one
    of five ABSVA event types, applies a 288-cell run-expectancy matrix, and
    aggregates to a per-catcher leaderboard.
